# Build context hygiene. Host node_modules must never reach the image: on
# Windows pnpm creates junctions that Docker sends as dangling absolute
# symlinks, and the build then fails inside `tsc`. Secrets stay out too.
node_modules
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/coverage
**/playwright-report
**/test-results
**/storage
.git
.github
.husky
.env
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
infra/backups
infra/certbot
infra/load
docs
*.md
!packages/shared/README.md
